        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Just as we look to the first few words of a sentence for what a sentence is about—its topic—so we look to the last few words for special emphasis: its stress. You can arrange a sentence to emphasize particular words that you want readers to hear stressed and thereby note as particularly significant.",
